  "music": "w3-big-tent-bother",
  "authorNotes": "Solo. Wide, generous piers (900px each) and two short, familiar gaps — a single trapeze (trapeze-breather-a, pivot flush with the starting pier's own edge at 900,640, 260px bar) and a single trampoline (trampoline-breather-b, flush with the middle pier at 2050,830) — nothing here should feel like a test after 04. All three objectives are gettable on one relaxed pass: grab camera-5 and both relics on the way (relic-w3-05-a is right on the starting pier, relic-w3-05-b right on the middle pier — neither requires a detour), and snap the photo (allSeatsInFrame + allAirborne) mid-arc on the trapeze or mid-bounce on the trampoline. No checkpoint: the whole level is short enough to stay under the no-checkpoint cap, and a death just means a quick, easy replay."
